    "id": "atomic_court",
    "name": "Atomic Court",
    "author": "Tile Trigger",
    "description": "A tiny cul-de-sac in the desert: two two-storey houses face each other across a street blocked by a school bus and a truck, each with a garage, a lawn and a fenced backyard. Fast and close, for 2–12 players; the flags are in the backyards and King of the Hill moves between the bus and the two upstairs landings.",
